{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["And the sense of <b>the woman whom You gave to be with me</b> is: the woman whom You in Your glory gave to me as a helper — she gave me from the tree, and I thought that whatever she would say to me would be for my help and benefit. And this is what He says in punishing him, \"Because you listened to the voice of your wife\" — that he was not worthy of transgressing His commandment on account of her counsel. And our Sages (in tractate Avodah Zarah 5a) call him in this an ingrate; they intend to explain that he answered Him: You caused me this stumbling, for You gave me a woman as a helper and she counseled me to do wickedly."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:24:11.363129668Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}